# Copy to `.dev.vars` for `npm run dev`. `.dev.vars*` is gitignored.
#
# Better Auth's cookie/token signing secret. Any long random string works
# locally; production/staging use a real secret set per-project with
# `wrangler secret put BETTER_AUTH_SECRET --name dreamport` (or
# `--name dreamport-staging`).
BETTER_AUTH_SECRET=dev-only-change-me-to-something-random-and-long

# Cloudflare Turnstile SECRET key, used server-side to verify the widget
# token on the send-OTP path. The send path fails closed (503) without it.
# This default is Cloudflare's documented always-pass test secret — it pairs
# with the always-pass site key in `.env`. Production/staging set a real
# per-project secret with `wrangler secret put TURNSTILE_SECRET_KEY
# --name dreamport` (or `--name dreamport-staging`); see docs/deployment.md.
TURNSTILE_SECRET_KEY=1x0000000000000000000000000000000AA

# How sign-in emails are delivered. Unset (or `mock`) prints the 6-digit code
# to the dev-server console and sends nothing — the default for local work.
# Set `resend` only to exercise the real Resend path; it then requires both
# vars below and throws on first use if either is missing.
# EMAIL_MODE=resend
# RESEND_API_KEY=re_...
# EMAIL_FROM=onboarding@resend.dev
